  "summary": "Independently checked all three axes for core.mjs against AGENTS.md, requirements.md, contracts.md and contracts.skill.yaml; existing-tests.mjs supplied context. No separate repository-conformance finding. Read-only Node probes reproduced the failure-to-completion transition and examined stop assessment ordering. No shell commands, writes or network access occurred. The existing suite was not executed because its imports do not resolve; probes used synthetic in-memory receipts. Next action: correct unknown-failure handling and add the described regression."
